  "details": "(Using Deepl.com translation)\nPlease change the selection method of the Talk/Mute button from OnClick to OnMouseDown.\nIn the new LaunchPad, the Talk/Mute button is smaller.\nThe VR controller is prone to camera shake, so selecting it when the trigger is pressed is a better match.\nAlso, the system sound is generated by OnMouseDown, so there are many situations where people misunderstand that the Talk/Mute button is working.",
